  "scope": "Post-hoc diagnostic prompted by non-exact-parent ADC photo outputs. Actual16 original arrays,FP64 displacement from parent in DN16. This is displacement,not target error;target error stays in full fixed scores. Constant RAW tests do not establish ADC photo identity or noisy-flat safety. No weights,loss,training or inference changed."
